            >
              Book Now
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <p>
        <em
          >Initial cleanings and non-regular cleanings may be more expensive depending on the condition of the property.</em
        >
      </p>
      <br />
      <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
        Need a custom quote for larger properties or special requirements?
      </p>
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-semibold hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-blue-300 transition"
      >
        Contact us for a personalized quote →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
